[[["duration"],"f077165785806d4f","Ciągle: każda misja zajmuje 30–90 min; każde powtarzalne zadanie 10–60 min"],[["summary"],"c95ba2dc7c8f3fdc","Zestaw misji i powtarzalnych zadań w Rathleton i Oramond (zwany też Rathleton Tasks lub Glooth Factory Quest). Pomagasz naukowcom, strażnikom i mieszkańcom w walce z bandytami, minotaurami, zmutowanym glooth i innymi problemami miasta. Każda misja lub zadanie daje prawa głosu w {wiki:Rathleton Magistrate|Rathleton Magistrate}, których używasz, żeby awansować na wyższe ranki w {wiki:Rathleton Quest|Rathleton Quest}."],[["start","label"],"68353066d7e2932c","Terrence, Workshop Quarter w Rathleton (zadania bez ranku)"],[["requirements",0],"1c42cf7dfb253a6f","Konto **Premium**."],[["requirements",3],"49961eeb0ba2c769","Niektóre kill tasks od {npc:Terrence} wymagają rangi: The Name of the Beast i The Minor Taurs (Commoner), Rust in Pieces (Inhabitant), The Major Taurs (Citizen)."],[["unlocks",0,"what"],"19fd4fc6b41851ac","Ranki w Rathleton Quest"],[["unlocks",0,"when"],"2ab610f6b5520778","Każda misja lub zadanie daje prawa głosu w {wiki:Rathleton Magistrate|Rathleton Magistrate}: 50 dla Commoner, 150 dla Inhabitant, 300 dla Citizen i 500 dla Squire."],[["unlocks",1,"what"],"532497b5ee82f061","Necrometer z Dark Trails Quest"],[["unlocks",1,"when"],"1cfcfee729a94d8b","Po wykonaniu zadania **Probing** od {npc:Doubleday} {npc:Jondrin} da ci już {item:Necrometer}."],[["unlocks",1,"note"],"8fa8232dd04b26f3","{wiki:Dark Trails Quest|Dark Trails Quest} wymaga też innych zadań z tego questa (na przykład The Ancient Sewers)."],[["sections",0,"steps",0,"coords",0,"label"],"58941eea7ff7fc4e","Captain Bluebear (port w Thais)"],[["sections",0,"steps",0,"coords",1,"label"],"c4faafa2d70dd8b6","Tratwa Captain Gulliver (przybycie)"],[["sections",0,"steps",0,"coords",2,"label"],"dcfcbe02fac7b10c","Pagórek, na który trafiasz ze Slime Slide"],[["sections",0,"steps",0,"coords",3,"label"],"48d73a22427c1ab8","Portal na małej łódce"],[["sections",0,"step